<title>USA: PETsMART names Schnabel as CFO.</title>
<headline>PETsMART names Schnabel as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PETsMART Inc said Thursday it had named Susan Schnabel as its its senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>She succeeds Donald Dorsey, who will remain with the company as executive vice president for corporate development.</p>
<p>Schnabel joins PETsMART from Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, where she was a managing director in the firm's Investment Banking Division.</p>
